<section class="space-y-10">
  <div class="space-y-4">
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-zinc-500">License Plate Tracker</p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-zinc-900 sm:text-5xl">
      Track every state plate you spot on the road.
    </h1>
    <p class="max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-zinc-600">
      Find State Plates is a Phoenix + LiveView app for road trips. Create trips, toggle states from an alphabetical checklist or SVG map, and open quick trivia for every state without leaving the page.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
    <.link navigate={~p"/users/register"} class="rounded-lg bg-zinc-900 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-zinc-700">
      Create an account
    </.link>
    <.link navigate={~p"/users/log_in"} class="rounded-lg border border-zinc-200 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-900 hover:bg-zinc-50">
      Log in
    </.link>
  </div>

  <div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3">
    <article class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-200 p-5">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-900">Trips</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-600">Each user can keep multiple trips with notes, start dates, and a dedicated checklist of seen states.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-200 p-5">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-900">Live map</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-600">A lightweight SVG tile map uses <code>phx-click</code> on each state, so updates stay server-driven and fast.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-200 p-5">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-900">Trivia</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-600">Open a modal with state-specific trivia as soon as a state catches your eye.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
